          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When the poison takes hold, victims turn purple. Blood from a pierced forearm turns dark purple, and purple blood can run from the nose.",
        "chapters": [
          75
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later clash Wang Da’s ten nails are half a palm long, purple and dark, with fog-state poison circulating them. At the last charge those nails reach fifty centimetres and stab like knife blades.",
        "chapters": [
          76
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Narration calls Love Life Separation the number one poison among the rank two Gu worms.",
        "chapters": [
          75
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is a rank two strong poison Gu, and narration calls it the strongest rank two poison.",
        "chapters": [
          76
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_poison_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo later repeats the rank two number one poison wording after the assassin is identified.",
        "chapters": [
          77
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
